                                                <h1 class='postTitle'>Is AI Destroying the Classroom, or Is the Classroom Finally Catching Up?
                                                </h1>
                                                <div class='postMeta'>
                                                    <div class='postAuthorAndTimestamp'>
                                                        <span class='authorImage'>
                                                            <span class='hasImage'
                                                                data-style='https://www.evidentmonthly.in/storage/authors/01KBRP57S1R73Y3WHYKQQ403MA.jpg'></span>
